- In part (2), assuming spatial diffusion exists directly in the PDE (no $ p_{xx} $ term) without recognizing emergent diffusion from velocity dynamics.  
*Calculation Traps*:  
- Sign errors during integration by parts in part (1), leading to incorrect ODE coefficients.  
- In part (2), miscalculating the effective diffusivity by neglecting velocity autocorrelation properties of the Ornstein-Uhlenbeck process.  
*Completeness Traps*:  
- Deriving the ODE for $ N(t) $ in part (1) but failing to analyze its long-term behavior for $ u_1 > 1 $.  
- In part (2), stating spatial uniformity without linking the effective diffusion equation to the decay of non-uniform Fourier modes on the circle.

