- *Calculation Trap*: Misapplying the Clausius-Clapeyron equation (e.g., using approximate forms without clarifying assumptions) or omitting the dependence of saturation mixing ratio $ w_s $ on $ T_{\text{parcel}} $. Errors in chain-rule differentiation during derivation (e.g., $ dw_s/dT $) are likely.
